    {
      "source": "An abstract base class for <a href=\"../SockJsService.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs\"><code>SockJsService</code></a> implementations that provides SockJS\npath resolution and handling of static SockJS requests (for example, \"/info\", \"/iframe.html\",\netc).",
      "translation": "一个抽象基类，为 `<a href=\"../SockJsService.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs\"><code>SockJsService</code></a>` 实现提供 SockJS 路径解析和静态 SockJS 请求的处理（例如，\"/info\", \"/iframe.html\"等）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Server-side support for SockJS transports including\n<a href=\"../transport/TransportHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs.transport\"><code>TransportHandler</code></a> implementations\nfor processing incoming requests, their\n<a href=\"../transport/session/AbstractSockJsSession.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs.transport.session\"><code>session</code></a>\ncounterparts for sending messages over the various transports, and\n<a href=\"../transport/handler/DefaultSockJsService.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs.transport.handler\"><code>DefaultSockJsService</code></a>.",
      "translation": "服务器端支持 SockJS 传输，包括用于处理传入请求的 <a href=\"../transport/TransportHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs.transport\"><code>TransportHandler</code></a> 实现、用于通过各种传输发送消息的其 <a href=\"../transport/session/AbstractSockJsSession.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs.transport.session\"><code>session</code></a> 对应对象，以及 <a href=\"../transport/handler/DefaultSockJsService.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs.transport.handler\"><code>DefaultSockJsService</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
