      "translation": "`<a href=\"../transport/TransportHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs.transport\"><code>TransportHandler</code></a>` 实现类以及具体的 `<a href=\"../SockJsService.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.sockjs\"><code>SockJsService</code></a>`。",
